30
00:20:40.000 --> 00:21:25.000
Additionally, the hotel employees wore green pants with grey shirts, and none had reported seeing anyone drop off an intoxicated woman to the lobby in the early hours. The police told Beth that a detective would be sent out to visit her the following morning. That night, she and Jug stayed in Natalie's hotel room, leaving the lamp on in the hopes she would return. Beth later stated, That's what parents do. You leave your light on, and wait until your child comes home.

