00:33:31.000 --> 00:34:18.000
quoted the lyrics of a linnard skinnard song titled Free Bird that went, If I leave here tomorrow would you still remember me for I must be travelling on now cause there's too many places I've got to see. The police spoke to locals who said there were several vagrants referred to as quote beach bums who frequented the Palm Beach area surrounding the Holiday Inn. Some were known to sleep on the hotel sun lounges overnight. Police questioned a known beach bum and thief named Marlon Sallaire who said he had been on the beach near the Holiday Inn on the night of Natalie's disappearance.

