00:34:55.000 --> 00:35:27.000
Hotel. Marlon's statement was backed by a Holiday Inn employee who had also seen two security guards from the Allegro Hotel milling about the pool area on the night of Sunday, May 29. He told police that one of the security guards often frequented their establishment to hit on female tourists. Another staff member told police that he had seen a dark-spinned man wearing black talking to a blonde woman who resembled Natalie Holloway.

