01:04:49.000 --> 01:05:33.000
manslaughter and kidnapping resulting in death. Chief Prosecutor Karen Jansen described his actions as disturbing and obstructive. His wife Anita held a press conference in the Vandersloh's backyard, calling her husband's arrest ridiculous. She accused the American media of hijacking the Aruban justice system, saying, This is not about Natalie anymore. It's about enormous pressure from the states and the media. I believe in my husband. I believe in my son. Paulus was released from custody two days later due to a lack of evidence justifying

