01:15:19.000 --> 01:16:02.000
She was accompanied by a film crew from American cable channel MSNBC. She stood over him silently for several minutes before asking him a string of questions, including whether he was involved in Natalie's disappearance, or if he had tried to help her. Beth offered him a choice between the reward money or life in prison. Deepak responded that his lawyer had advised him to remain silent. Police suspected that Yoran's best friend and neighbour, Freddy Zaddan, knew more than he was letting on. It had been brought to their attention that Freddy had allegedly taken explicit photographs of an underage teenager, which he had then posted

